# The widget cites this software. The flagship study is The Price of Order
# in Disaggregated Inference (in preparation): preferred-citation flips to
# it when it publishes. Arrow is credited for the scheduling algorithms.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use narwhal, cite the software below. The measurement study is 'The Price of Order in Disaggregated Inference' (Georgiou, 2026, in preparation) - cite it once published. Cite the Arrow paper for the algorithms the scheduling core implements."
title: "narwhal"
type: software
version: 0.1.2
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/athrael-soju/Narwhal"
authors:
  - name: "Athrael Soju"
keywords:
  - llm
  - inference
  - disaggregation
  - scheduling
